WEBVTT

01:49.500 --> 01:54.910
[A Dream Within A Dream]

01:55.020 --> 01:58.030
[Episode 1]

02:16.630 --> 02:20.350
[Song Yimeng, the legitimate
daughter of Minister of War]

02:24.490 --> 02:27.360
[Nan Heng, the Seventh Prince]

02:40.250 --> 02:41.890
If you still don't show up,

02:41.920 --> 02:43.470
it'll be too late.

02:50.730 --> 02:52.810
[Chu Guihong,
Junior General of Qianyu Army]

02:58.360 --> 02:59.150
Chu Guihong,

03:00.150 --> 03:01.590
so you came after all.

03:01.780 --> 03:03.170
You killed my father

03:03.360 --> 03:04.520
and stole my wife.

03:05.030 --> 03:07.630
Today, I'll settle
all scores, old and new,

03:08.010 --> 03:09.830
and end your life, monster!

03:09.870 --> 03:11.200
I doubt

03:11.720 --> 03:13.730
you're capable of that.

03:29.600 --> 03:30.530
General Chu.

03:31.470 --> 03:32.280
General Chu.

03:32.280 --> 03:33.079
Yimeng.

03:37.250 --> 03:38.230
General Chu.

03:38.600 --> 03:39.840
I've made up my mind.

03:40.470 --> 03:42.520
Why do you have to keep pushing me?

03:43.400 --> 03:44.190
Yimeng.

03:44.380 --> 03:46.250
How can I stand by and watch you

03:46.520 --> 03:48.400
marry a murderous fiend

03:48.670 --> 03:50.000
and throw your life away

03:50.150 --> 03:51.520
like this?

03:52.079 --> 03:53.540
So what if he's murderous?

03:53.730 --> 03:55.160
So what if he's a fiend?

03:55.530 --> 03:57.020
Even if this is a mistake,

03:57.280 --> 03:58.930
it's one I'd gladly make

03:58.950 --> 04:00.130
again and again!

04:00.710 --> 04:01.430
Yimeng!

04:01.430 --> 04:02.240
Well, well.

04:02.710 --> 04:04.220
One is a traitor,

04:04.320 --> 04:05.940
the other is my woman.

04:06.040 --> 04:08.050
Old lovers reunited,

04:08.470 --> 04:10.760
flirting in public

04:11.280 --> 04:13.240
on the day of my wedding

04:13.480 --> 04:14.740
before the whole city.

04:15.400 --> 04:16.870
Am I dead to you?

04:17.890 --> 04:18.880
Yimeng!

04:18.950 --> 04:19.810
Your Highness.

04:21.390 --> 04:22.250
Your Highness.

04:23.110 --> 04:24.590
You've misunderstood me.

04:25.380 --> 04:26.730
I'm deeply

04:27.050 --> 04:28.530
in love with you.

04:29.890 --> 04:31.200
Deeply in love with me?

04:34.780 --> 04:35.600
Okay.

04:37.159 --> 04:37.950
Then…

04:40.680 --> 04:42.000
prove it to me.

04:42.950 --> 04:47.409
♪ On January 18th,
an auspicious day, she got married ♪

04:46.310 --> 04:47.120
Nan Heng!

04:48.390 --> 04:49.470
Let her go!

04:48.770 --> 04:53.190
♪ Clad in red,
she buried pain and regret ♪

04:51.490 --> 04:52.360
Your Highness!

04:54.470 --> 04:59.490
♪ She faked smiles, longing for
the one who never returned ♪

05:00.060 --> 05:04.830
♪ Joyful music played,
but no one knew her sorrow ♪

05:06.160 --> 05:12.300
♪ At the altar,
she let her true heart speak ♪

05:06.800 --> 05:07.600
Yimeng.

05:08.270 --> 05:09.290
General Chu.

05:12.040 --> 05:12.830
I'm sorry.

05:14.710 --> 05:16.650
I failed you in this life.

05:17.460 --> 05:18.550
In the next life,

05:19.300 --> 05:20.870
I'll do everything I can

05:22.330 --> 05:23.700
to make it up to you.

05:23.620 --> 05:24.900
♪ They were childhood sweethearts ♪

05:25.380 --> 05:26.460
Sorry.

05:25.760 --> 05:27.210
♪ Go ahead and stab ♪

05:28.610 --> 05:32.470
♪ On January 18th,
an auspicious day, she got married ♪

05:29.440 --> 05:30.470
Yimeng!

05:32.470 --> 05:33.530
♪ The groom was so happy ♪

05:33.560 --> 05:34.420
Your Highness.

05:35.310 --> 05:35.870
Why…

05:35.870 --> 05:36.600
What?

05:37.120 --> 05:38.390
Didn't you say you'd willingly

05:38.390 --> 05:39.920
do anything for me?

05:40.760 --> 05:44.380
♪ Lost for words,
she smiled like she was fine ♪

05:44.870 --> 05:48.580
♪ Could you tell
she was crying behind that smile? ♪

05:48.970 --> 05:50.690
♪ Did you notice
the tears behind her smile? ♪

05:50.720 --> 05:53.100
♪ Bow to heaven and earth ♪

05:53.220 --> 05:54.390
If you hurt her,

05:54.420 --> 05:55.490
you die!

05:58.740 --> 05:59.890
If you hurt him,

05:59.420 --> 06:02.620
♪ Bow to the parents ♪

06:00.020 --> 06:01.280
you die!

06:03.200 --> 06:04.200
Today,

06:04.510 --> 06:05.830
we all die!

06:10.970 --> 06:13.130
♪ Bow to each other ♪

06:13.730 --> 06:19.080
♪ At the altar, at the altar ♪

06:18.780 --> 06:22.340
[Honor Your Roots]

06:20.070 --> 06:24.280
♪ If the promise is broken,
how can you move on? ♪

06:25.010 --> 06:35.750
♪ She sang of childhood love, waiting for
the one to come back; go ahead and stab ♪

06:28.040 --> 06:29.270
My goodness.

06:29.760 --> 06:30.890
They're spinning.

06:38.500 --> 06:40.500
[The wind howls. They spins faster.
Their fates intertwine again.]

06:40.500 --> 06:40.820
[On to the next scene]

06:41.850 --> 06:48.390
[Agent]

06:44.680 --> 06:45.430
Sorry.

06:46.750 --> 06:48.010
What's wrong with you?

06:48.240 --> 06:49.270
Sorry, Director.

06:49.270 --> 06:50.920
Sorry, I need to cut in for a second.

06:50.920 --> 06:52.310
I'm just not sure

06:52.310 --> 06:54.430
what exactly
this scene is trying to convey.

06:54.430 --> 06:57.390
Nan Heng is the male lead here.

06:57.870 --> 07:00.240
Why is the script making him

07:00.240 --> 07:01.950
so dumb?

07:01.970 --> 07:03.190
He doesn't even see it coming

07:03.190 --> 07:04.730
when the second male lead
tries to stab him.

07:04.730 --> 07:06.830
No defense, no strategy.

07:07.120 --> 07:08.980
He just stands there and takes it.

07:09.250 --> 07:10.230
[Director]

07:10.690 --> 07:12.180
[Screenwriter, Bei Xiong]

07:14.430 --> 07:15.870
Ms. Na, it's like this.

07:16.230 --> 07:18.390
This whole love-triangle,
stabbing-each-other thing

07:18.390 --> 07:20.560
is an iconic scene

07:20.560 --> 07:22.160
in costume dramas.

07:22.360 --> 07:23.680
Audiences love this kind of

07:23.680 --> 07:25.720
over-the-top, messy drama.

07:25.720 --> 07:26.980
Platforms love it too.

07:27.040 --> 07:28.890
But have you guys thought this through?

07:28.890 --> 07:29.800
The female lead's

07:29.800 --> 07:31.950
second wedding
is an iconic scene in the story.

07:31.880 --> 07:34.790
[Nan Feng]

07:32.020 --> 07:33.810
Do you know what that means?

07:33.920 --> 07:35.720
It's supposed to hype the audience.

07:35.720 --> 07:37.830
And yet the male lead has no heroic moment

07:37.830 --> 07:39.360
and nothing swoon-worthy at all.

07:39.360 --> 07:41.190
Three full pages for this key scene,

07:41.190 --> 07:42.630
but Nan Feng only has

07:42.630 --> 07:44.270
105 words of dialogue.

07:44.270 --> 07:47.000
How do you expect
the audience to love the male lead?

07:47.000 --> 07:48.310
Forget the audience.

07:49.000 --> 07:50.130
Did you fall for him?

07:51.070 --> 07:52.190
Did you?

07:53.580 --> 07:55.220
I don't know if I fell for him,

07:55.680 --> 07:57.159
but she's surely good at math.

07:57.159 --> 07:58.159
Shut up.

07:58.159 --> 07:58.909
Ms. Na,

07:59.070 --> 08:00.310
it's not that serious.

08:00.310 --> 08:02.190
This is a TV series.

08:02.240 --> 08:03.510
This is just one scene.

08:03.510 --> 08:04.850
There are plenty more down the line

08:04.850 --> 08:06.000
to make the male lead shine.

08:06.000 --> 08:07.690
Where are they, Director?

08:07.920 --> 08:10.120
Actually, what we're asking for is simple.

08:10.120 --> 08:11.190
Out of all 900 scenes,

08:11.190 --> 08:13.480
I want all the key moments
and dramatic beats

08:13.480 --> 08:15.980
to go to the male lead.

08:16.000 --> 08:17.930
Any conflict, any crisis?

08:17.960 --> 08:20.650
Let him be the one to handle it.

08:21.000 --> 08:22.500
900 scenes,

08:22.550 --> 08:23.750
and he only has three months.

08:23.750 --> 08:24.830
Can he even finish them?

08:24.830 --> 08:26.310
Be quiet.

08:26.310 --> 08:27.190
Look,

08:27.190 --> 08:29.560
we're not trying
to make things hard for the crew.

08:29.560 --> 08:30.270
Honestly,

08:30.270 --> 08:32.150
with Feng's current status,

08:32.150 --> 08:33.789
fans and offers
of dramas and variety shows

08:33.789 --> 08:35.270
just keep pouring in.

08:35.270 --> 08:36.960
His last male lead role finished shooting

08:36.960 --> 08:39.070
in just a month and a half.

08:39.120 --> 08:41.840
This time, we're giving you
an extra 45 days

08:41.870 --> 08:44.840
because we trust
the production team and the director.

08:44.840 --> 08:45.670
So,

08:45.790 --> 08:47.270
when we hit a problem…

08:47.270 --> 08:48.480
He finished it
in a month and a half?

08:48.480 --> 08:49.510
Shut up!

08:49.510 --> 08:51.440
We should work together to fix it.

08:51.600 --> 08:52.550
And anyway,

08:52.600 --> 08:56.170
doesn't he have body doubles
for everything, including nude scenes?

08:56.170 --> 08:57.240
He has...

08:57.390 --> 08:58.870
a body double for nude scenes?

08:58.870 --> 08:59.670
You don't?

09:00.600 --> 09:03.000
How can we be brought down
by a little problem like this?

09:03.000 --> 09:03.720
Am I right?

09:03.790 --> 09:04.650
Yeah. Totally.

09:04.670 --> 09:07.120
About the male lead's schedule,

09:07.120 --> 09:08.780
we'll take it very seriously.

09:08.910 --> 09:10.080
We'll sort it out

09:10.080 --> 09:11.510
before filming starts.

09:11.790 --> 09:12.860
Thank you, Director.

09:12.860 --> 09:14.440
I knew this production team

09:14.440 --> 09:16.230
was a hidden gem.

09:16.270 --> 09:17.560
You're so professional.

09:17.560 --> 09:18.600
[Producer]

09:23.350 --> 09:23.910
[Agent] [Song Xiaoyu]

09:25.500 --> 09:26.950
[Nan Feng]

09:27.470 --> 09:30.830
[Nan Feng]

09:29.390 --> 09:30.200
Well...

09:30.720 --> 09:32.320
the title's not quite right.

09:32.630 --> 09:34.720
Why is it called "A Dream of Qingning?"

09:33.140 --> 09:35.640
[Agent] [Song Xiaoyu]

09:35.030 --> 09:36.790
It has nothing to do

09:35.750 --> 09:39.030
[A Dream of Qingning]

09:36.840 --> 09:39.120
with our male lead, Nan Heng.

09:39.120 --> 09:40.510
The font is wrong too.

09:40.190 --> 09:41.500
[Nan Feng as Nan Heng]

09:40.630 --> 09:41.720
Songti

09:41.720 --> 09:43.790
kills the vibe instantly.

09:43.790 --> 09:45.510
You should bold it and make it bigger.

09:45.510 --> 09:46.390
Also…

09:46.390 --> 09:47.790
When was the poster shot?

09:47.840 --> 09:49.300
Why didn't they inform us?

09:49.550 --> 09:51.350
Don't worry. We'll shoot later.

09:51.360 --> 09:53.000
Shut up. Stop talking.

09:53.030 --> 09:53.840
Just listen.

09:54.230 --> 09:57.070
[Agent]

09:54.440 --> 09:57.150
Fake death scenes
need to be handled carefully too.

09:57.150 --> 09:58.360
In this business,

09:58.360 --> 09:59.510
that kind of stuff messes

09:59.510 --> 10:00.270
with your luck.

10:00.270 --> 10:01.840
Next, let's talk about perks.

10:01.840 --> 10:03.960
Nan Feng is a little special.

10:04.120 --> 10:05.440
He needs 19 staff.

10:06.320 --> 10:08.030
One driver. Two personal assistants.

10:08.030 --> 10:09.870
Four work assistants. Six bodyguards.

10:09.870 --> 10:12.360
Two agents. Two personal stylists.

10:12.390 --> 10:13.200
And one…

10:13.870 --> 10:14.840
And one

10:15.080 --> 10:15.960
set photographer.

10:15.960 --> 10:18.270
And also a chef
who can cook French cuisine.

10:18.270 --> 10:18.910
Yes.

10:18.960 --> 10:20.320
How did you know?

10:20.840 --> 10:22.500
His reputation precedes him.

10:24.080 --> 10:24.840
Actually,

10:24.840 --> 10:27.360
Nan Feng doesn't care about any of that.

10:27.390 --> 10:29.120
But as his agent,

10:29.120 --> 10:30.670
I need to think things through.

10:30.670 --> 10:32.000
You all know how powerful

10:32.000 --> 10:33.390
Feng's fans,

10:33.390 --> 10:35.320
Pumpkins, are.

10:35.390 --> 10:37.270
When it comes to flooding feeds
and controlling the narrative,

10:36.530 --> 10:38.720
[Acting all high and mighty]

10:37.270 --> 10:39.240
he's never lost.

10:39.240 --> 10:42.000
Since we've cleared
enough time in his schedule for this show,

10:42.000 --> 10:44.720
we have to make sure
the quality is up to par.

10:44.870 --> 10:46.510
Actors need good roles,

10:46.750 --> 10:49.000
but roles need good actors just as much.

10:49.080 --> 10:50.550
The fans want to see their idol

10:50.550 --> 10:51.750
get the treatment he deserves.

10:51.750 --> 10:52.720
I don't want to see

10:52.720 --> 10:54.200
everyone here and the studio

10:54.200 --> 10:56.240
getting flamed online later.

10:56.240 --> 10:57.030
Fine.

10:58.120 --> 10:59.520
We'll revise the script.

10:59.630 --> 11:00.870
No wire work.

11:01.200 --> 11:03.130
If there's a cliff-jumping scene,

11:03.200 --> 11:04.550
you'll do it.

11:04.790 --> 11:06.790
If there's a death scene, I'll do it.

11:07.270 --> 11:08.160
This drama

11:08.240 --> 11:09.570
has other cast members.

11:09.630 --> 11:11.630
Why don't we hear what they think?

11:15.240 --> 11:16.200
Need a hand?

11:17.910 --> 11:18.870
You got it?

11:18.870 --> 11:19.870
It's so kind of you.

11:19.870 --> 11:21.230
Really appreciate it.

11:21.360 --> 11:22.200
I'm good with anything.

11:22.200 --> 11:22.910
Well,

11:23.200 --> 11:24.910
you guys know more
about scripts than I do.

11:24.910 --> 11:26.270
I'll go with whatever you decide.

11:26.270 --> 11:27.200
You're so nice.

11:27.200 --> 11:27.670
What a good actor.

11:27.670 --> 11:28.630
Thank you. Thank you.

11:28.630 --> 11:29.630
How about Xiaoyu?

11:29.960 --> 11:31.870
Director, guys,

11:32.240 --> 11:33.190
this is

11:33.670 --> 11:35.630
my first time
playing such an important role.

11:35.630 --> 11:37.390
My acting is not that great,

11:37.630 --> 11:38.750
and there are

11:39.200 --> 11:40.320
a ton of lines.

11:40.740 --> 11:41.870
How about this?

11:41.960 --> 11:43.670
As soon as I step out of the palanquin,

11:43.670 --> 11:44.870
I faint.

11:44.910 --> 11:45.750
No lines.

11:45.910 --> 11:47.310
I don't have to say a word.

11:47.630 --> 11:48.910
She's just kidding.

11:48.910 --> 11:49.550
I'm serious.

11:49.550 --> 11:50.480
I actually think

11:50.550 --> 11:52.360
that suits her character.

11:52.960 --> 11:53.870
Hold on, hold on.

11:53.870 --> 11:54.960
Ms. Na, Xiaoyu,

11:55.000 --> 11:55.930
we can't do that.

11:56.270 --> 11:58.080
This scene is supposed to show

11:58.100 --> 12:00.560
the love triangle
among these three characters.

12:00.560 --> 12:01.810
If you faint…

12:02.200 --> 12:04.400
Right. The love triangle is important.

12:04.480 --> 12:05.360
How about this?

12:05.790 --> 12:06.550
I

12:06.550 --> 12:07.950
step out of the palanquin

12:08.240 --> 12:10.320
and faint right at Feng's feet.

12:10.360 --> 12:12.200
Feng, you don't even have to look at me.

12:12.200 --> 12:13.120
Just kick me straight over

12:13.120 --> 12:14.960
to Liangchen.

12:15.750 --> 12:17.390
How's that, Mr. Bei?

12:17.750 --> 12:19.350
A love triangle.

12:19.550 --> 12:20.360
Fine.

12:21.270 --> 12:23.200
Let's kick it into a love triangle.

12:23.510 --> 12:24.320
Alright?

12:24.360 --> 12:25.270
It's decided.

12:25.320 --> 12:26.240
Revise the script.

12:26.240 --> 12:27.030
Okay?

12:27.250 --> 12:28.510
It's getting late.

12:28.510 --> 12:29.910
We'll stop here for today

12:29.960 --> 12:30.720
and pick up again tomorrow.

12:30.720 --> 12:31.390
Thank you, Director.

12:31.390 --> 12:31.670
Thank you.

12:31.670 --> 12:33.440
Thank you, Director.

12:34.000 --> 12:34.930
Thank you.

12:35.000 --> 12:36.670
Thank you, Director. Thank you, everyone.

12:35.490 --> 12:36.160
[Nan Feng]

12:36.670 --> 12:37.870
Thank you, Director.

12:41.240 --> 12:42.440
Collect your things.

12:43.390 --> 12:44.650
-Bye, Director.
-Bye.

12:49.350 --> 12:50.400
Oh my god.

12:50.880 --> 12:52.120
So high-maintenance.

12:52.120 --> 12:53.320
Collect your things.

12:54.110 --> 12:55.240
Goodbye, Director.

12:56.840 --> 12:58.870
Feng, fly free!

12:59.080 --> 13:01.140
Pumpkins will always be by your side!

13:01.440 --> 13:04.030
Flawless skin, heart-shaped lips,

13:04.200 --> 13:06.670
and legs for days!

13:07.000 --> 13:08.960
"A Dream of Qingning" shines bright!

13:08.960 --> 13:11.080
Not loving Feng just ain't right!

13:11.080 --> 13:13.550
Flawless skin, heart-shaped lips,

13:13.630 --> 13:16.000
and legs for days!

13:16.200 --> 13:18.030
Feng, fly free!

13:18.240 --> 13:20.300
Pumpkins will always be by your side!

13:28.870 --> 13:30.510
Being famous is nice.

13:30.670 --> 13:32.470
Fans are always waiting for him.

13:32.550 --> 13:34.510
He doesn't even have to speak for himself.

13:34.510 --> 13:35.480
His agent, Ms. Na,

13:35.480 --> 13:36.720
is like a machine gun.

13:36.720 --> 13:38.320
When she talks,
all I hear is rat-tat-tat-tat.

13:38.320 --> 13:39.030
If you ask me,

13:39.030 --> 13:40.670
the most exhausting thing he did today

13:40.670 --> 13:41.870
was sit there all afternoon

13:41.870 --> 13:43.670
fiddling with his prayer beads.

13:43.910 --> 13:44.840
Are you jealous?

13:45.630 --> 13:47.160
Do you want to be famous too?

13:47.300 --> 13:49.340
Then try harder!

13:49.480 --> 13:50.870
I told you to dress in something bright

13:50.870 --> 13:52.440
to grab a bit of his spotlight.

13:52.440 --> 13:53.600
Look at you.

13:53.630 --> 13:54.440
Tell me,

13:54.440 --> 13:56.300
who's gonna take pictures of you?

13:56.550 --> 13:57.270
Didn't you see

13:57.270 --> 13:59.360
the dress the company prepared for me?

13:59.360 --> 14:00.440
Low-cut.

14:00.600 --> 14:01.510
Super short.

14:01.510 --> 14:02.550
How was I supposed to wear that?

14:02.550 --> 14:03.200
If I did,

14:03.200 --> 14:05.030
his Pumpkins would tear me apart.

14:05.030 --> 14:05.790
Girl,

14:05.910 --> 14:07.320
as a Z-list actress,

14:07.320 --> 14:08.870
you have to ride someone else's wave.

14:08.870 --> 14:09.440
Selling the ship?

14:09.440 --> 14:09.960
You won't do it.

14:09.960 --> 14:10.390
On-set photos?

14:10.390 --> 14:10.960
You won't take any.

14:10.960 --> 14:11.840
Last month,

14:11.840 --> 14:14.150
I fought so hard
to land you a variety show.

14:14.150 --> 14:15.000
And what did you do?

14:15.000 --> 14:15.960
You didn't

14:15.960 --> 14:17.870
steal the spotlight
or build a persona.

14:17.870 --> 14:20.120
You literally fell asleep in the show!

14:20.120 --> 14:21.550
Wasn't it a "slow-life" reality show?

14:21.550 --> 14:23.210
Only you took that literally.

14:23.360 --> 14:24.510
No one else did.

14:25.000 --> 14:27.150
Miss Song, Song Xiaoyu,

14:27.150 --> 14:28.670
if you don't wanna stay in this business,

14:28.670 --> 14:29.600
then just quit.

14:29.600 --> 14:30.720
Don't keep dragging down

14:30.720 --> 14:31.390
my KPIs every month

14:31.390 --> 14:32.920
and make me starve with you!

14:33.670 --> 14:34.480
What's wrong?

14:34.480 --> 14:36.400
You mad, Huang?

14:36.510 --> 14:38.390
Huang. Huang.

14:38.480 --> 14:39.750
Didn't we agree?

14:38.980 --> 14:45.290
[Feng faces every storm head-on.]

14:39.750 --> 14:40.910
I'll let my works speak for me.

14:40.910 --> 14:42.030
Stop, stop.

14:42.870 --> 14:43.670
Works?

14:44.030 --> 14:45.720
Let me make this clear one last time.

14:45.720 --> 14:47.030
You got to play the female lead this time

14:47.030 --> 14:48.510
not because I'm capable

14:48.510 --> 14:49.270
or because

14:49.270 --> 14:51.150
the producers think you have potential.

14:51.150 --> 14:53.270
It's mainly because the director

14:53.270 --> 14:54.550
went through

14:54.550 --> 14:56.080
every actress in the industry

14:56.080 --> 14:57.030
who's willing

14:57.030 --> 14:59.440
to play second fiddle to Nan Feng,

14:59.440 --> 15:00.630
and you were the only one left.

15:00.630 --> 15:01.550
You get what I'm saying?

15:01.550 --> 15:03.150
I get it. I totally get it.

15:03.150 --> 15:04.320
So don't worry.

15:04.320 --> 15:05.360
I'll give it my all.

15:05.360 --> 15:07.390
No way I'll embarrass you.

15:08.240 --> 15:09.840
Costume fitting's tomorrow. Don't be late.

15:09.840 --> 15:10.600
I have to go.

15:10.600 --> 15:11.360
Okay, okay.

15:11.650 --> 15:18.970
[Feng faces every storm head-on.]

15:12.960 --> 15:13.960
Stay safe.

15:22.390 --> 15:25.220
[Feng, fly free.
Pumpkins will always be by your side.]

15:23.960 --> 15:27.920
♪ On the boulevard ♪

15:28.630 --> 15:33.050
♪ Lovers drive by slow ♪

15:34.570 --> 15:38.630
♪ Playing the heartbreaking radio ♪

15:36.440 --> 15:37.700
What's wrong with you?

15:41.390 --> 15:45.390
♪ Down that lonely road ♪

15:49.460 --> 15:53.710
♪ Somewhere true love can last forever ♪

15:53.060 --> 15:55.690
[Magnolia Awards]

15:55.720 --> 15:57.530
[Song Xiaoyu's version
of the Magnolia Awards]

15:56.190 --> 16:00.060
♪ If you're willing to dream on ♪

15:57.660 --> 16:00.240
[Slacker]

16:02.360 --> 16:03.490
A former child star,

16:03.840 --> 16:05.480
I graduated from a top acting school.

16:05.480 --> 16:06.750
I used to believe

16:06.960 --> 16:09.960
I'd become
a big-name actress with countless offers.

16:10.390 --> 16:11.440
But in the end?

16:10.650 --> 16:11.890
[Milk tea equals instant joy.]

16:11.510 --> 16:13.870
Landing a role is just dumb luck.

16:15.860 --> 16:16.840
Forget it.

16:16.020 --> 16:21.130
[Just lie flat.
Someone else will take care of it.]

16:17.300 --> 16:18.770
I'm lucky to have gotten this role.

16:18.770 --> 16:20.250
So stop complaining.

16:23.550 --> 16:24.750
Come on, Song Xiaoyu.

16:25.240 --> 16:26.080
Time to work.

16:30.720 --> 16:32.320
"A Dream of Qingning."

16:33.910 --> 16:35.510
Indeed not a good name.

16:35.790 --> 16:37.990
It doesn't really match Feng's status.

16:43.200 --> 16:46.000
"Song Yimeng lost her mother young.

16:46.020 --> 16:47.750
Though she was
neglected by her stepmother,

16:47.750 --> 16:50.280
her father's overprotection and indulgence

16:50.550 --> 16:52.480
made her grow up soft and fragile."

16:54.360 --> 16:55.320
"She always thought

16:55.320 --> 16:57.910
she'd marry Chu Guihong,
to whom she was betrothed

16:56.430 --> 17:00.170
[A Dream of Qingning, Episode 2, Scene 28]

16:57.910 --> 16:59.120
in childhood…

17:01.510 --> 17:04.569
until that day
at the flower banquet in the royal garden

17:04.680 --> 17:07.160
when she ran into
Great Jing's God of Death,

17:07.790 --> 17:10.790
the Seventh Prince, Nan Heng."

17:42.880 --> 17:45.000
Classic palace drama stuff.

17:45.400 --> 17:46.790
I know this plot so well.

17:47.270 --> 17:49.470
I've done this scene in several dramas.

17:49.680 --> 17:50.650
This time,

17:51.160 --> 17:52.690
I'll act in a different way.

17:59.660 --> 18:03.560
[A Dream of Qingning,
Episode 10, Scene 21]

18:02.030 --> 18:04.070
Oh no! Fire!

18:04.510 --> 18:05.680
There's a fire!

18:08.880 --> 18:09.680
Get up!

18:12.160 --> 18:12.960
Watch out!

18:41.370 --> 18:42.340
Your Highness.

18:42.510 --> 18:43.400
Are you okay?

18:43.420 --> 18:44.820
Are you hurt anywhere?

18:48.590 --> 18:49.510
Just a scratch.

18:49.510 --> 18:50.310
It's nothing.

18:52.880 --> 18:53.550
But you,

18:55.050 --> 18:57.710
who said you could leave me
without permission?

18:57.830 --> 18:58.690
Your Highness.

19:00.960 --> 19:01.820
Your Highness.

19:03.070 --> 19:04.400
I won't run off again.

19:05.020 --> 19:06.690
I'll never leave you again.

19:17.880 --> 19:19.200
Girl, seriously?

19:19.880 --> 19:21.610
You fall for him just like that?

19:22.400 --> 19:24.870
Even over-the-top CEOs
in dramas aren't this cringe.

19:24.870 --> 19:27.240
No danger? Create one
to make him look cool.

19:27.240 --> 19:29.680
No plot? Force one
to make them fall in love.

19:34.430 --> 19:37.960
[A Dream of Qingning,
Episode 17, Scene 13]

19:35.270 --> 19:36.070
Foolish girl!

19:36.750 --> 19:38.030
Stop!

19:41.790 --> 19:43.680
Think carefully.

19:44.440 --> 19:46.030
If you walk out that door today

19:46.030 --> 19:47.440
and run out on this wedding,

19:47.440 --> 19:48.680
you'll have

19:49.200 --> 19:51.400
nothing more to do with the Song family!

19:51.960 --> 19:57.890
♪ Without ups and downs, the fireflies
in the dark would mean nothing ♪

19:53.270 --> 19:54.070
Father.

19:55.240 --> 19:56.000
I really...

19:56.000 --> 19:57.000
Shut up!

19:57.160 --> 19:59.680
I don't have
a shameless daughter like you.

19:59.650 --> 20:04.630
♪ Never once doubting
the net of fate that traps us both ♪

20:00.070 --> 20:01.550
You've disgraced

20:02.270 --> 20:04.090
the entire Song family!

20:06.090 --> 20:12.360
♪ Someone wrote the story,
and now it's running through our veins ♪

20:06.830 --> 20:07.640
Father!

20:09.830 --> 20:11.030
Chu Guihong and I

20:11.920 --> 20:13.650
were betrothed by our parents.

20:14.010 --> 20:15.300
There's no love between us.

20:14.950 --> 20:17.070
♪ The future hangs by a thread,
caught in the cycle of karma ♪

20:15.530 --> 20:17.530
But it's different
with the Seventh Prince.

20:17.530 --> 20:19.800
He and I truly love each other!

20:17.930 --> 20:20.700
♪ The signs are always there,
but the ending remains unknown ♪

20:20.480 --> 20:21.920
Even if one day

20:21.830 --> 20:24.600
♪ Everything passes like a flicker—
all just smoke and bubbles ♪

20:21.940 --> 20:23.540
he becomes the crown prince,

20:23.810 --> 20:25.490
I'll stand with him
through thick and thin.

20:25.490 --> 20:31.000
♪ All those wild rumors
somehow feel true, you said ♪

20:26.300 --> 20:28.400
If he falls from grace
and loses everything,

20:28.400 --> 20:30.480
I'll stay by his side till the very end!

20:30.480 --> 20:31.440
So today,

20:32.180 --> 20:34.010
even if the whole world turns against me,

20:32.320 --> 20:41.990
♪ I'm not who I used to be,
just playing a part ♪

20:34.240 --> 20:35.880
even if my own family casts me out,

20:35.880 --> 20:38.000
I still won't marry Chu Guihong!

20:38.920 --> 20:39.620
You...

20:43.500 --> 20:49.130
♪ Eyes losing light,
how many storms still lie ahead? ♪

20:50.240 --> 20:52.970
♪ Now that I've set out,
the vast world is waiting for me ♪

20:54.060 --> 20:59.520
♪ So I'll live like it matters,
love like I mean it ♪

21:01.110 --> 21:03.110
So she believes love is everything?

21:03.510 --> 21:05.310
She gives up her life and family

21:05.640 --> 21:07.790
for a jerk she's only met twice.

21:10.120 --> 21:11.730
At this rate,

21:13.460 --> 21:15.790
is she going to
live frugally for him next?

21:19.400 --> 21:23.740
[A Dream of Qingning,
Episode 22, Scene 12]

22:02.360 --> 22:03.420
Song Yiting!

22:05.650 --> 22:07.400
He's your brother-in-law!

22:12.030 --> 22:13.550
He was my brother-in-law.

22:13.830 --> 22:14.750
But from now on,

22:15.000 --> 22:16.400
he'll be my husband.

22:19.920 --> 22:21.000
Nonsense.

22:21.270 --> 22:22.270
Nonsense!

22:31.880 --> 22:34.480
I don't need you
to tell me what I can or can't do.

22:34.720 --> 22:35.350
Get lost!

22:42.690 --> 22:43.440
Gosh!

22:43.460 --> 22:45.460
What the hell? He actually hits her?

22:46.620 --> 22:47.830
If I were her,

22:47.830 --> 22:49.490
I'd slap him dead right there.

22:51.880 --> 22:52.920
And is slapping

22:52.920 --> 22:54.980
some secret formula for going viral?

22:55.200 --> 22:57.860
Even short dramas
don't pull this crap anymore.

23:00.920 --> 23:02.920
So she doesn't live frugally for him.

23:02.920 --> 23:04.850
Wang Baochuan did better than her.

23:08.730 --> 23:13.570
[A Dream of Qingning,
Episode 37, Scene 19]

23:19.830 --> 23:21.160
Snowy night.

23:22.000 --> 23:22.920
Red dress.

23:24.070 --> 23:24.880
Hold on.

23:25.000 --> 23:26.310
You're not going to

23:26.340 --> 23:28.070
jump off the building, are you?

23:47.400 --> 23:50.000
Qianyu rebels, let me go!

23:51.720 --> 23:52.960
Let me go!

23:53.000 --> 23:54.400
Kidnapping the Noble Consort

23:54.400 --> 23:55.680
is a capital offense!

23:56.400 --> 23:57.400
No way.

23:57.400 --> 23:58.930
Isn't this a suicide scene?

23:59.480 --> 24:02.540
Are we really doing
the classic "choose one" drama now?

24:03.720 --> 24:04.480
Nan Heng!

24:04.720 --> 24:06.550
You killed loyal officials
and the emperor!

24:06.550 --> 24:07.720
You don't deserve to rule!

24:07.720 --> 24:08.510
Today,

24:08.510 --> 24:10.720
we're here to avenge General Chu!

24:11.550 --> 24:13.030
Both these women

24:13.240 --> 24:14.840
are carrying your children.

24:15.070 --> 24:16.420
If you want them to live,

24:16.590 --> 24:18.320
take your own life here and now!

24:22.920 --> 24:24.310
You dare threaten me?

24:24.790 --> 24:25.590
Your Majesty!

24:25.640 --> 24:26.990
Please save me.

24:27.160 --> 24:28.720
I'm Yiting, Your Majesty!

24:28.790 --> 24:29.580
Nan Heng!

24:31.900 --> 24:32.960
You once said

24:34.400 --> 24:36.350
you owe me too much in this life.

24:38.330 --> 24:40.450
If you still have any conscience…

24:40.470 --> 24:41.350
Fire!

25:11.590 --> 25:12.440
Are you okay?

25:18.850 --> 25:21.080
So it was all fake

25:21.860 --> 25:23.410
from beginning to end.

25:54.880 --> 25:57.590
What kind of plot is this?

25:58.110 --> 25:59.880
Nan Heng is absolute scum!

26:00.240 --> 26:01.900
The storyline makes no sense.

26:02.780 --> 26:04.950
And the female lead is such an idiot.

26:05.200 --> 26:06.530
How am I supposed to act?

26:09.680 --> 26:13.490
[A Dream of Qingning,
Episode 39, Scene 1]

26:23.110 --> 26:25.550
The female lead falls off the city wall,

26:25.550 --> 26:26.440
survives,

26:26.440 --> 26:28.370
and is turned into a living corpse?

26:28.460 --> 26:29.500
Screenwriter,

26:29.830 --> 26:32.430
can you please write
like a normal human being?

26:48.590 --> 26:49.830
What's going on?

26:49.830 --> 26:50.960
Why can't I move?

27:19.610 --> 27:20.330
This...

27:21.200 --> 27:22.680
What is this place?

27:24.240 --> 27:24.680
Wait.

27:25.000 --> 27:26.540
When did my home decoration

27:26.720 --> 27:28.550
turn into neo-Chinese style?

27:30.770 --> 27:31.970
Where's my manicure?

28:04.750 --> 28:05.550
Oh my god.

28:07.390 --> 28:09.080
A-Am I dreaming?

28:09.160 --> 28:11.420
Or did I sleepwalk straight onto the set?

28:13.400 --> 28:14.440
Wake up.

28:14.440 --> 28:15.640
Wake up.

28:16.480 --> 28:18.110
We're doing the costume fitting today.

28:18.110 --> 28:19.240
If I'm late,

28:19.550 --> 28:21.480
Huang's definitely gonna kill me.

28:22.740 --> 28:24.450
Wake up. Hurry.

28:27.510 --> 28:28.110
Wait.

28:28.800 --> 28:31.880
What's going on?

28:31.910 --> 28:33.880
There's so much gold in this dream.

28:38.760 --> 28:40.700
I need to sleep a little longer.

28:40.920 --> 28:42.830
It's not that I don't want to wake up.

28:42.830 --> 28:45.810
These gold ingots are just too tempting.

28:45.920 --> 28:46.720
Imagine this:

28:47.680 --> 28:49.440
rolling back and forth

28:49.440 --> 28:50.640
on such a big bed every day,

28:50.640 --> 28:53.640
surrounded by piles of gold and jewelry.

28:56.160 --> 28:57.400
I'm so happy.

28:58.120 --> 28:59.390
This has to be a dream.

28:59.640 --> 29:00.400
Definitely a dream.

29:00.400 --> 29:01.720
Definitely a dream.

29:03.350 --> 29:04.160
My Lady?

29:05.830 --> 29:07.090
My Lady, you're awake.

29:09.480 --> 29:11.780
My Lady, it's time to get dressed.

29:10.000 --> 29:13.800
[Yingqiu, the Song family's maid]
[Zhixia, the Song family's maid]

29:14.310 --> 29:16.720
I also have so many maids?

29:18.160 --> 29:19.070
Who am I?

29:19.480 --> 29:20.590
Where am I?

29:22.590 --> 29:24.280
My Lady, what's wrong?

29:24.400 --> 29:26.000
Yingqiu, go get the physician.

29:26.000 --> 29:26.790
Wait.

29:28.340 --> 29:29.490
Yingqiu?

29:29.750 --> 29:31.750
Isn't that the maid from the script?

29:34.310 --> 29:35.410
I...

29:35.130 --> 29:37.260
[Laiyi House]

29:37.510 --> 29:38.590
My Lady!

29:39.010 --> 29:42.090
[Laiyi House]

29:39.590 --> 29:40.440
My Lady.

29:40.830 --> 29:41.640
My Lady.

29:42.180 --> 29:43.660
[Room of Elegance]

29:42.680 --> 29:43.480
My Lady.

29:45.830 --> 29:47.310
Laiyi House?

29:47.540 --> 29:51.170
[Room of Elegance]

29:49.230 --> 29:50.880
Come, let me ask you.

29:52.650 --> 29:54.450
This place wouldn't happen to be

29:55.030 --> 29:56.440
the Song Residence outside Shiqiao Gate

29:56.440 --> 29:57.640
in the western part
of Great Jing's capital,

29:57.640 --> 29:59.440
home of Song Yude,
Duke of Guangping, Minister of War,

29:59.440 --> 30:01.590
and Left Vice Minister
of the Imperial Secretariat, right?

30:01.590 --> 30:02.590
Yes, My Lady.

30:02.680 --> 30:04.270
This is the Song Residence
outside Shiqiao Gate

30:04.270 --> 30:05.400
in the western part
of Great Jing's capital,

30:05.400 --> 30:07.000
home of Song Yude,
Duke of Guangping, Minister of War,

30:07.000 --> 30:09.930
and Left Vice Minister
of the Imperial Secretariat.

30:15.350 --> 30:16.590
What about me?

30:16.920 --> 30:18.650
Don't tell me I'm that poor girl

30:18.680 --> 30:20.030
Song Yimeng,
the legitimate eldest daughter

30:20.030 --> 30:21.680
whose mother died early.

30:21.680 --> 30:22.440
Exactly.

30:22.440 --> 30:24.160
You are the poor girl Song Yimeng

30:24.160 --> 30:25.240
whose mother…

30:27.200 --> 30:28.790
My Lady, it's your wedding day.

30:28.790 --> 30:30.000
How could you say that?

30:30.000 --> 30:30.930
That's ominous.

30:33.720 --> 30:35.200
I traveled to another dimension

30:35.200 --> 30:36.510
and ended up inside the script?

30:36.510 --> 30:38.810
And I'm that cursed girl, Song Yimeng!

30:39.190 --> 30:45.620
[Laiyi House]

30:39.510 --> 30:41.320
-Nope. I've gotta go.
-My Lady.

30:41.350 --> 30:43.070
Let go of me! I don't want to die.

30:43.070 --> 30:44.200
My Lady, you can't leave!

30:44.200 --> 30:46.530
Please put on your wedding dress, My Lady.

30:48.640 --> 30:49.440
Wedding?

30:50.200 --> 30:51.010
Let go!

30:53.120 --> 30:54.770
Listen, I'm not getting married.

30:54.670 --> 30:59.140
[Laiyi House]

30:54.800 --> 30:56.550
If you want to be stabbed by Nan Heng,

30:56.550 --> 30:57.110
you can marry him.

30:57.110 --> 30:58.000
My Lady.

30:58.020 --> 30:59.030
-My Lady.
-My Lady.

30:59.030 --> 30:59.960
My Lady.

31:00.910 --> 31:02.510
What's wrong with you guys?

31:02.880 --> 31:05.200
General Chu's
wedding procession is almost here.

31:05.200 --> 31:07.400
If you keep dawdling,
it'll be too late.

31:09.110 --> 31:10.110
What did you say?

31:10.310 --> 31:11.440
If you keep dawdling, it'll be…

31:11.440 --> 31:12.200
No, no,

31:12.400 --> 31:13.670
before that.

31:14.000 --> 31:15.400
General Chu Guihong's

31:15.400 --> 31:17.400
wedding procession is almost here.

31:18.590 --> 31:21.110
So the guy I'm marrying is Chu Guihong?

31:21.550 --> 31:22.350
Yes.

31:22.790 --> 31:23.920
Not Nan Heng?

31:23.920 --> 31:25.030
Of course not.

31:25.030 --> 31:25.790
Yes!

31:26.510 --> 31:28.510
How could I forget that?

31:29.000 --> 31:31.000
In the script,
Song Yimeng's first marriage

31:31.000 --> 31:32.790
was supposed to be with Chu Guihong.

31:32.790 --> 31:34.510
She only ran away to marry Nan Heng

31:34.510 --> 31:35.770
because she lost her mind.

31:35.770 --> 31:37.260
This time I'm not running.

31:37.400 --> 31:38.980
This beautiful life

31:39.010 --> 31:40.620
will be mine to live.

31:44.310 --> 31:45.440
Help me get changed.

31:47.640 --> 31:48.720
Congratulations.

31:48.720 --> 31:50.000
You're all too kind.

31:50.000 --> 31:51.240
You brought so many gifts.

31:51.240 --> 31:52.310
Thank you, guys.

31:52.310 --> 31:53.600
Congratulations.

31:54.790 --> 31:56.510
Why are you still
fooling around at a time like this?

31:55.500 --> 31:59.420
[Song Yude, Duke of Guangping, Left Vice Minister
of the Imperial Secretariat, and Minister of War]

31:59.350 --> 32:00.310
Stand properly.

32:02.960 --> 32:03.830
Yimeng.

32:04.520 --> 32:06.070
You lost your mother young.

32:06.310 --> 32:09.270
I intended
to keep you home a few more years,

32:10.790 --> 32:14.250
but Chu Guihong requested
a marriage decree from His Majesty.

32:14.350 --> 32:15.330
So be it.

32:15.480 --> 32:17.480
He's always away
fighting on the battlefield,

32:17.480 --> 32:19.070
but he's an honest man,

32:19.640 --> 32:21.100
and he truly cares for you.

32:21.310 --> 32:22.200
In the future,

32:22.300 --> 32:23.780
live a good life with him.

32:27.030 --> 32:27.880
Master,

32:28.110 --> 32:29.440
you don't need to worry.

32:31.330 --> 32:33.680
Song Yimeng marrying General Chu

32:31.410 --> 32:35.190
[Zhou Xueyi, Song Yimeng's stepmother]
[Song Yiting, Song Yimeng's younger sister]

32:33.720 --> 32:35.590
is definitely marrying up.

32:35.640 --> 32:36.960
After you get there,

32:37.030 --> 32:38.960
don't forget your younger sister.

32:39.680 --> 32:41.400
What a classic stepmother.

32:41.620 --> 32:42.790
Look at her expression.

32:42.790 --> 32:45.070
It's not easy to look so mean.

32:46.500 --> 32:47.800
A mean stepmother,

32:48.030 --> 32:49.480
a conflict-avoiding father,

32:49.480 --> 32:51.410
and a cold, pretty younger sister.

32:52.200 --> 32:54.240
Exactly like the script.

32:54.680 --> 32:56.340
Mother, stop talking.

32:56.370 --> 32:58.150
You think everyone is

32:58.310 --> 32:59.550
as snobbish as her?

33:00.200 --> 33:01.920
H-How could you speak like that?

33:01.920 --> 33:04.130
An auspicious hour, a joyous day.

33:03.350 --> 33:05.440
[Persistence]

33:08.240 --> 33:09.960
Bride, it's time.

33:09.960 --> 33:11.300
We should set off now.

33:19.370 --> 33:24.460
[Song Residence]

33:25.550 --> 33:27.770
The bride is setting off!

33:28.330 --> 33:30.760
[Chu Guihong,
Junior General of Qianyu Army Chu]

33:32.220 --> 33:35.310
He really does
look just like Chu Liangchen.

33:36.070 --> 33:37.550
It's the auspicious time.

33:37.550 --> 33:39.240
Lift the bridal palanquin!

33:45.510 --> 33:46.690
Congratulations.

33:46.790 --> 33:47.930
Congratulations.

33:49.550 --> 33:51.270
Congratulations.

33:53.830 --> 33:55.490
Congratulations to the bride!

33:55.490 --> 33:57.200
Congratulations to the bride!

33:57.200 --> 33:58.960
Congratulations.

34:02.370 --> 34:03.720
I used to think

34:03.880 --> 34:05.590
