rich and prestigious.

34:14.400 --> 34:15.510
What a grand start.

34:15.650 --> 34:17.530
I'm winning at life!

34:19.139 --> 34:21.000
I'm winning at the starting line.

34:23.159 --> 34:24.540
Mother,

34:24.670 --> 34:27.360
the bride is so pretty.

34:27.400 --> 34:29.000
I like her.

34:29.670 --> 34:30.639
Thank you.

34:33.320 --> 34:36.320
So this is what being
a top-tier celebrity feels like.

34:36.480 --> 34:37.800
Everyone I meet is nice.

34:37.800 --> 34:39.000
Every word I hear is sweet.

34:39.000 --> 34:41.500
No wonder everyone's dying to be famous.

34:43.110 --> 34:44.230
Stop! Stop!

34:44.230 --> 34:45.630
Where did the bandits come from?

34:45.630 --> 34:46.780
Stop!

34:47.030 --> 34:47.760
Stop!

34:47.760 --> 34:49.050
Qianyu Army,

34:49.080 --> 34:50.340
protect Her Ladyship!

34:51.860 --> 34:53.280
I don't care if there are bandits or not.

34:53.280 --> 34:55.280
-Stop! Stop!
-No matter what, I'm getting

34:55.280 --> 34:56.670
