34:57.880 --> 34:58.800
Stop! Stop!

34:58.800 --> 34:59.510
Stop!

35:06.400 --> 35:07.140
My Lady!

35:12.480 --> 35:14.460
Dying on my first day in this world?

35:14.480 --> 35:16.690
This is not in the script.

35:27.550 --> 35:28.510
What…

35:30.630 --> 35:31.440
Why am I…

35:32.230 --> 35:33.550
