35:37.320 --> 35:38.960
Greetings, My Lady.

35:39.400 --> 35:41.230
Please get changed.

35:43.510 --> 35:45.370
What the hell?

35:45.440 --> 35:47.190
The Chu family's
wedding procession is coming.

35:47.190 --> 35:49.390
If you keep dawdling, it'll be too late.

35:49.400 --> 35:50.190
Wait.

35:50.590 --> 35:51.920
I've learned my lesson.

35:53.400 --> 35:54.510
There's something

35:55.000 --> 35:56.400
