35:58.070 --> 35:59.610
It's the auspicious time.
Lift the bridal palanquin!

35:58.200 --> 36:03.880
[Playing at 2x speed]

35:58.810 --> 36:02.290
♪ Clap once, we ride together
in the bridal sedan ♪

36:03.010 --> 36:06.550
♪ Clap twice,
the Song family's rocket shoots high ♪

36:07.290 --> 36:08.340
♪ Riding in the bridal sedan ♪

36:08.840 --> 36:09.910
♪ Riding in the bridal sedan ♪

36:09.590 --> 36:11.070
Don't be nervous.

36:10.840 --> 36:12.130
