36:11.090 --> 36:13.030
I reinforced the palanquin this time.

36:13.030 --> 36:15.820
This loser life of mine is about to end.

36:15.060 --> 36:18.330
♪ Clap three times,
Guihong pays the bill ♪

36:15.920 --> 36:17.570
I'll be on a lucky streak!

36:17.600 --> 36:19.220
Everything will be fine this time.

36:19.220 --> 36:22.510
♪ Clap four times,
the loser turns the tables ♪

36:23.110 --> 36:24.150
♪ Riding in the bridal sedan ♪

36:23.590 --> 36:24.510
Mother.

36:24.550 --> 36:26.800
The bride is so pretty.

36:24.890 --> 36:26.060
♪ Riding in the bridal sedan ♪

36:26.840 --> 36:28.060
I like her.

36:27.000 --> 36:28.070
♪ Riding in the bridal sedan ♪

36:28.650 --> 36:29.680
♪ Riding in the bridal sedan ♪

36:31.150 --> 36:32.940
Why is she getting married again?

36:32.940 --> 36:34.230
What do you mean "again"?

36:34.230 --> 36:35.550
Speaking ill of General Chu's wife

36:35.010 --> 36:38.150
♪ Clap five times,
it's time to breakdance ♪

36:35.550 --> 36:36.810
