36:37.430 --> 36:38.460
This is weird.

36:38.480 --> 36:39.830
Where are the bandits?

36:39.170 --> 36:42.110
♪ Clap six times,
life is just so amazing ♪

36:40.920 --> 36:41.980
Congratulations.

36:43.230 --> 36:44.160
♪ Life is amazing ♪

36:44.940 --> 36:45.880
♪ Amazing, amazing, amazing ♪

36:46.550 --> 36:47.680
What's going on here?

36:46.790 --> 36:47.900
♪ Amazing, amazing, amazing ♪

36:48.890 --> 36:50.750
♪ Life is amazing ♪

36:54.320 --> 36:55.840
